From: "Sgt.Bilko" <59089219+SgtBilko76@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 28 Oct 2026 21:16:23 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 01/44] RRV bridge 0001: bridge target and local-memory entry
 points

Fukami tools/patches/pcsx2/0001 adapted to ARMSX2: the RewriteLargeST
backport (Config.h, GSState, GSRendererHW) is already in this tree from
upstream and is not duplicated; the local-memory entry points fail closed
unless the GS runs as one unqueued object (GSBackThreadMode Off).
---
